      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>In England, Ofsted inspects early years settings. It expects them to meet the Early Years Foundation Stage. It also expects them to know their own strengths and weaknesses. Self-evaluation is how you show that. Do it honestly. Record the proof when you see it. Keep the plan alive.</p>"
